($q$Monash University$q$, $q$Monash International Leadership Scholarship$q$, $q$Full$q$, $q$Undergraduate$q$, $q$NOT YET CHECKED against the official page: this came from a web search and the figures may be wrong or out of date. Confirm on the official page before you rely on it. Who is eligible: International students from any country, including Ghana, with an unconditional offer for an eligible undergraduate degree at a Monash campus in Australia. Requirements: Academic achievement is assessed. Recipients must maintain a Weighted Average Mark (WAM) of at least 70 each semester. Exclusions include some medical degrees, pathway programmes and transfers. How to apply: Automatic consideration after receiving an unconditional course offer. Deadline: Not stated.$q$, $q$100% of course tuition fees for the minimum duration of the degree.$q$, $q$https://www.monash.edu/study/fees-scholarships/scholarships/find-a-scholarship/monash-international-leadership-scholarship-5571Z$q$),
